            {
              "key": "submission_id",
              "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "ENQUEUE breakdown extraction for the submission's accepted ORDER document.\nRuns in Celery (Gemini extraction is 30\u2013200s \u2014 never on the request path).\n202 + task id; the UI polls GET or listens for the Realtime push.\n\nIdempotent: rows already exist -> already_ready (no re-run); a claim is held\nbut rows aren't written yet -> already_processing (no double-enqueue)."
      },
      "response": []
